GET https://localhost:7231/api/orders


### Protected Farmer Quotations
GET https://localhost:7231/api/farmer-quotations



### 1. Get All Marketplace Crops
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops


### 2. Search Crops - Tomato
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?q=tomato


### 3. Filter Vegetables
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?cat=Vegetables


### 4. Filter Fruits
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?cat=Fruits


### 5. Filter Grains
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?cat=Grains


### 6. Filter Price Under Rs.200
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?pr=lt200


### 7. Filter Price Rs.200-400
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?pr=200-400


### 8. Filter Organic Crops
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?tag=Organic


### 9. Filter Pesticide-Free Crops
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?tag=Pesticide-free


### 10. Sort Price Low to High
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?sort=priceasc


### 11. Sort Price High to Low
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?sort=pricedesc


### 12. Combined Marketplace Filters
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?q=tomato&cat=Vegetables&pr=200-400&tag=Organic&sort=priceasc


### 13. Get Crop Details
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops/1


### 14. Get Marketplace Homepage Statistics
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/stats


### 15. Test Invalid Category
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?cat=Electronics


### 16. Test Invalid Sorting
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?sort=random


### 17. Test Invalid Price Range
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops?pr=100-300


### 18. Test Invalid Crop ID
GET https://localhost:7231/api/marketplace/crops/0